      {
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 7.96,
        "text": "Most viewers miss this about JWST and mid-inferred Spectra X-Oplanet atmospheres, most people miss this, we don't see X-Oplanets as dots."
      },
      {
        "start": 9.08,
        "end": 10.06,
        "text": "Stay for the evidence."
      },
      {
        "start": 11.34,
        "end": 12.98,
        "text": "Visible light bounces off clouds."
      },
      {
        "start": 14.12,
        "end": 15.68,
        "text": "Mid-inferred penetrates dust."
      },
      {
        "start": 16.68,
        "end": 18.76,
        "text": "That's why we use it to find hidden molecules."
      },
      {
        "start": 20.16,
        "end": 26.12,
        "text": "From that penetrates, watch what this changes next, carbon dioxide leads a distinct dip at 4.3 microns."
      },
      {
        "start": 26.78,
        "end": 29.12,
        "text": "Nothing shows up at 3.3."
      },
      {
        "start": 30.1,
        "end": 31.16,
        "text": "These are the fingerprints."
      },
      {
        "start": 32.56,
        "end": 34.62,
        "text": "But the star is a million times brighter."
      },
      {
        "start": 35.68,
        "end": 36.98,
        "text": "We subtract its light."
      },
      {
        "start": 37.94,
        "end": 39.74,
        "text": "What remains is the planet's breath."
      },
      {
        "start": 40.88,
        "end": 43.12,
        "text": "From that brighter, water vapor is tricky."
      },
      {
        "start": 44.12,
        "end": 46.78,
        "text": "It can hide behind clouds or minic other gases."
      },
      {
        "start": 47.76,
        "end": 49.78,
        "text": "We need multiple bands to confirm."
      },
      {
        "start": 51.26,
        "end": 51.9,
        "text": "So..."
      }
    ],
